OL,3,AAudit regulator looking into Manchester
OL,4,ACity accounting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK audit regulator has confirmed it
OL,7,Fis leading inquiries into accounting
OL,8,Firregularities at Manchester City.
OL,10,FThe Financial Reporting Council
OL,11,Fconfirmed in a letter to the House of
OL,12,FCommons business select committee it
OL,13,Fhad taken over "regulatory
OL,14,Fconsideration" of the case from the
OL,15,FInstitute of Chartered Accountants in
OL,16,FEngland and Wales on 30 September.
OL,18,FNo formal investigation has started,
OL,19,Fbut the FRC is making inquiries into
OL,20,Fthe case.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
