OL,3,AAudit regulator looking into Manchester
OL,4,ACity accounting
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Manchester City were
OL,7,Ffound guilty by an independent
OL,8,Fcommission of all charges relating to
OL,9,Fbreaches of the Premier League's
OL,10,Ffinancial regulations between the
OL,11,F2009-10 and 2017-18 seasons, including
OL,12,Fby artificially inflating the club's
OL,13,Ffinancial position by more than #900m.
OL,14,FCity are appealing the verdict.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
